---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="The Studio — Ramia Studio" lang="en">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 min-h-[70vh]">
    <article class="prose prose-neutral prose-sm sm:prose-base mx-auto font-body text-neutral-600 space-y-6">
      
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl text-neutral-900 mb-8 font-light">The Studio</h1>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-800">At Ramia Studio we create pieces conceived under a non-negotiable premise: the most powerful jewelry is the one you don't feel.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-neutral-900 mt-8 mb-4">Acrylic Craftsmanship</h2>
      <p>Our production combines the precision of <strong>laser cutting</strong> with the care of <strong>manual assembly</strong> in our Spanish atelier. Every layer and every finding is assembled by hand.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-neutral-900 mt-8 mb-4">Zero Weight</h2>
      <p>Using acrylic allows us to sculpt bold volumes while keeping weights under 3 grams. Dare to wear maxi sizes without sacrificing comfort.</p>
  
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>